OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA chilly but largely sunny
OL,6,Fmorning with an early frost in places.
OL,7,FClouding over from the southeast from
OL,8,Flate morning with the odd spot of
OL,9,Flight rain possible.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FCloudy through the evening
OL,12,Fwith some patchy light rain possible.
OL,13,FStaying cloudy overnight with further
OL,14,Foutbreaks of light rain and freshening
OL,15,Fsoutheast winds.
OL,16,
OL,17,CTuesday:FLargely cloudy with rain -
OL,18,Fparticularly over Central - likely
OL,19,Fturning heavier and more persistent
OL,20,Fthrough the day. Quite breezy around
OL,21,Fthe coast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
