OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FCloudy
OL,6,Fon Wednesday with rain, brightening up
OL,7,Flater. Dry with bright spells on
OL,8,FThursday, the odd shower in the west.
OL,9,FTurning rather wet and windy through
OL,10,FFriday.
